:"Dance of ncc","content":"Get Ready to Groove with NCC Students!\n\nThis Sunday, our talented NCC students will be practicing their dance routine from 6:00 AM to 9:00 AM. We invite everyone to come and witness their hard work and dedication. The energy and enthusiasm will be infectious, and we're sure you'll have a blast cheering them on!\n\nSo, mark your calendars and join us for an exciting morning of dance practice. Let's show our support for these talented students and make this a memorable experience for everyone involved.","type":"general","target_role":"all","target_class_id":null,"scheduled_for":null,"status":"published","attachment_url":null,"created_at":"2025-12-13T10:14:53.961822+00:00","updated_at":"2025-12-13T10:14:53.961822+00:00"},{"id":"422d1607-fe69-4175-83d8-2268ef121f1a","school_id":"f0d07292-6347-41a1-a842-d21aa3e61561","created_by":"dee40b94-0a7a-41d2-a785-aaa12e474b00","title":"Exam incoming","content":"Important Exam Date: December 10\n\nAttention all students, we have an important exam scheduled for December 10. Make sure to mark your calendars and prepare accordingly. \n\nReview your study materials, attend any review sessions, and ask your teachers for help if you need it. We are confident that you will do your best and achieve great results.\n\nIf you have any questions or concerns, please reach out to your teachers or the school administration. We are here to support you throughout this process.\n\nLet's work together to make this exam a success!","type":"general","target_role":"all","target_class_id":null,"scheduled_for":null,"status":"published","attachment_url":null,"created_at":"2025-12-13T10:13:00.396701+00:00","updated_at":"2025-12-13T10:13:00.396701+00:00"}]},"expiresAt":1766140831955}]]